{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 42,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        42.10532760620117,
        140.85321044921875,
        51.10532760620117
      ],
      "text": "6.1 CHAPTER OBJECTIVES",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.528202056884766,
        60.276031494140625,
        399.7197265625,
        69.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "This chapter presents operational considerations that should be taken into account in",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.546199798583984,
        72.27304077148438,
        176.34017944335938,
        81.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "conducting contact investigations.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5641975402832,
        102.09934997558594,
        184.48519897460938,
        111.09934997558594
      ],
      "text": "6.2 OPERATIONAL CONSIDERATIONS",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.57320022583008,
        120.09934997558594,
        136.6951904296875,
        129.09934997558594
      ],
      "text": "6.2.1 Written guidelines",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.57320022583008,
        132.26705932617188,
        399.7469787597656,
        141.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "All TB control programmes should have written guidelines for the use of and approaches to",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.58220291137695,
        144.26406860351562,
        399.8100280761719,
        153.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "contact investigation. Contact investigation is an acknowledged standard component of TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.63620376586914,
        156.26107788085938,
        400.24200439453125,
        165.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "control programmes and should therefore be included in programme manuals. At a minimum,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.63620376586914,
        168.27304077148438,
        399.8043212890625,
        177.27609252929688
      ],
      "text": "the guidelines should include the emphasis to be placed on contact investigation, priorities",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.6306037902832,
        180.27005004882812,
        399.6246337890625,
        189.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "for evaluation and the roles and responsibilities of programme personnel in investigations",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.44160079956055,
        192.26705932617188,
        400.128173828125,
        201.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "and in collecting and recording relevant data. If contact investigation is to be undertaken,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51359939575195,
        204.26406860351562,
        399.6965637207031,
        213.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "written, standardized protocols and procedures should be prepared and followed. Such",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52260971069336,
        216.27008056640625,
        399.61090087890625,
        225.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "standardized protocols improve the efﬁciency and uniformity of an investigation and allow",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.46408462524414,
        228.26995849609375,
        85.3760986328125,
        237.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "evaluation.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.46408462524414,
        258.09625244140625,
        298.8741149902344,
        267.09625244140625
      ],
      "text": "6.2.2 Determining the level of emphasis for contact investigation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.48208236694336,
        270.26397705078125,
        399.51190185546875,
        279.26397705078125
      ],
      "text": "National and local TB control programmes should determine how much emphasis to place on",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.33808517456055,
        282.260986328125,
        399.530029296875,
        291.260986328125
      ],
      "text": "contact investigation on the basis of the local epidemiology of TB, operational capacity and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.36508560180664,
        294.25799560546875,
        401.5934143066406,
        303.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "resources. In general, contact investigation should be assigned a lower priority in countries",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.46639633178711,
        304.15374755859375,
        401.5481262207031,
        315.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "< or areas in which treatment success is   85%. Where there is a high prevalence of HIV or",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.421382904052734,
        318.27008056640625,
        399.63116455078125,
        327.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "MDR-TB or XDR-TB, all of which reduce treatment success rates, contact investigation may be",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.46638107299805,
        330.26708984375,
        399.3076171875,
        339.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "valuable. Moreover, there may be cities or regions within countries where the local programme",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.14238357543945,
        342.26409912109375,
        399.69879150390625,
        351.2758483886719
      ],
      "text": "is performing adequately even though the national rates for treatment success are below the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53377914428711,
        354.2728576660156,
        399.6716613769531,
        363.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "goal. Such localized areas may consider adopting additional case detection strategies, such as",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.49777603149414,
        366.2698669433594,
        126.53077697753906,
        375.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "contact investigation.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.011775970458984,
        396.2668762207031,
        253.8446807861328,
        405.2668762207031
      ],
      "text": "Case study: routine contact investigation in Morocco",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.02309799194336,
        408.27606201171875,
        391.0254211425781,
        417.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "Morocco is a low–middle-income country where DOTS has been implemented successfully",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.8610954284668,
        420.2730712890625,
        391.3669738769531,
        429.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "since 1991. TB contact investigations are a routine activity of the national TB programme.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.8340950012207,
        432.27008056640625,
        390.98016357421875,
        441.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "The results of contact investigations undertaken between 1993 and 2004 were recently",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.816097259521484,
        444.2670593261719,
        390.8454895019531,
        453.2670593261719
      ],
      "text": "reviewed (40). The proportion of contacts identiﬁed among those screened, the prevalence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.69009780883789,
        456.2640686035156,
        391.2411804199219,
        465.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "of active TB cases among those screened and the proportion of cases identiﬁed in contacts",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.07711410522461,
        468.2700500488281,
        391.1507568359375,
        477.2700500488281
      ],
      "text": "among all new cases registered were calculated for each year and for each diagnostic",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.987117767333984,
        480.2670593261719,
        391.1687927246094,
        489.2670593261719
      ],
      "text": "category. More than 1 million household contacts were identiﬁed in about 200 000",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.01411819458008,
        492.2640686035156,
        392.9963684082031,
        501.2640686035156
      ],
      "text": "investigations. On average, 77% of identiﬁed contacts were evaluated for TB each year.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.87911605834961,
        504.26104736328125,
        391.4886474609375,
        513.263671875
      ],
      "text": "The overall prevalence of any type of TB among screened household contacts was 2.5%,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.89280319213867,
        516.2606811523438,
        391.57135009765625,
        525.2786865234375
      ],
      "text": "and the proportion of all new TB cases identiﬁed during contact investigation was 5.6%;",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.99361038208008,
        526.15185546875,
        391.53546142578125,
        537.2711791992188
      ],
      "text": "< the proportion of all cases in children   10 years of age was signiﬁcantly higher (19.5%).",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.00260543823242,
        540.2681884765625,
        391.1932373046875,
        549.2681884765625
      ],
      "text": "The authors concluded that performing contact investigation as a routine activity of the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.03860855102539,
        552.2651977539062,
        366.1734619140625,
        561.2651977539062
      ],
      "text": "national TB programme was feasible and useful in low–middle-income countries.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        216.7593994140625,
        651.97265625,
        225.45188903808594,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "40",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}